Package: jarvis-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: jarvisd (= @VERSION@), jarvis-pkg (= @VERSION@), jarvis-diag (= @VERSION@), jarvis-helper (= @VERSION@), jarvis-cli (= @VERSION@), jarvis-archive-keyring (= @VERSION@)
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: Jarvis AI agent for Debian and Ubuntu, in the terminal
 Installs the Jarvis brain (jarvisd), its package and diagnosis tools, the
 privileged helper and the jarvis terminal client on an existing Debian 13
 or Ubuntu 24.04 system. No desktop shell and no distribution branding.
